Package: brch
Title: Danish Industry Codes: DB07 and DB25
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Madsen", email = "danielmadsen@live.dk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Work with the Danish industry classifications DB07 and DB25
    (Dansk Branchekode) from Statistics Denmark. Format codes, add labels,
    inspect which classification a code belongs to, and convert between
    DB07 and DB25 with the bundled keys, offline.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://dataniel.github.io/brch, https://github.com/dataniel/brch
BugReports: https://github.com/dataniel/brch/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5)
Imports:
    tibble
Suggests:
    dplyr,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
